  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Human rights, tools for children and adolescents</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project prevents human trafficking and sexual crimes in students from elementary to high school. Reduce gender violence. It is based on Art, so it raises awareness and helps prevent violence with aesthetic experiences. 50 Human Rights and Violence Prevention workshops will be given through Theater in 10 schools for 1,500 children and adolescents from highly marginalized communities. He specializes in the Maestros de Mexico elementary school in Cuajimapla de Morelos.</narrative>
  </description>
